# Service

Tech capability, no SQL. `{Context}Service`. Wired in [api](./api.mdc).

## Logic

- How: hash, crypto, format
- Not: policy (“email must be unique”) → [application](./application.mdc)

## Do

- Methods like `hashPassword`, `verifyPassword`

## Don't

- DB / repository / oRPC
- Call from [router](./router.mdc)

```ts
export class AuthService {
  async hashPassword(plain: string): Promise<string> {
    return await bcrypt.hash(plain, ROUNDS);
  }
}
```
